<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Eurotel to offer Slovak GSM March 1.</title>
<headline>Eurotel to offer Slovak GSM March 1.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotel Bratislava, a joint venture between US West Media Group, Bell Atlantic Intl and Slovenske Telekomunikacie will begin offering its Global System for Mobile (GSM) phone service as of March 1, 1997.</p>
<p>US West said in a statement from its Prague office on Monday that the service will begin operating in Slovakia's three largest cities -- Bratislava, Banksa Bystrica and Kosice.</p>
</text>
